---
import Layout from "$layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout title="Finger on the Trigger">
  <div class="max-w-lg p-2">
    The lyrics tool supports offline mode. Just wait a while and its pages should
    be loaded and ready to go, even if you lose your internet connection.<br
    /><br />

    You may need to add this site to your home screen to get it to work offline.
    <p class="mt-4">
      <a href="/in-ear/" class="link">In Ear</a> is a listening lab for learning
      monitor setups. It requires an internet connection; music loads only when
      you press Play and is not included in the lyrics tool’s offline downloads.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
